            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[# PortDeck 0.1.0-beta.17

- Makes provider customization more direct with drag-to-reorder controls while keeping Local fixed at the front.
- Stabilizes provider reordering feedback so rows follow pointer movement predictably.
- Shows how long each active Local development session has been running.
]]></description>
